<title>USA: Wang ups credit facility to $225 million.</title>
<headline>Wang ups credit facility to $225 million.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wang Laboratories Inc said on Tuesday its revolving credit facility was amended on Aug 29, increasing it to $225 million from $125 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the credit facility would continue to provide liquidity for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Bankers Trust Co is the agent. BayBank, part of Bank of Boston Corp, Fleet National Bank, Lehman Commercial Paper Inc and Riggs Bank are co-agents.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
